  "translatedBlocks": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac8111aa6e810015",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴地宣布，Scaleway 现已成为 Hugging Face Hub 支持的推理提供商！Scaleway 加入了我们不断壮大的生态系统，进一步拓宽了直接在 Hub 模型页面上进行无服务器推理的覆盖范围，并增强了其能力。推理提供商也已无缝集成到我们的客户端 SDK（同时支持 JS 和 Python）中，让你能够非常轻松地通过自己偏好的提供商使用各种模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ee4e3f0cba4d8e9",
      "translationZh": "此次上线让你能够比以往更轻松地直接从 Hugging Face 访问 gpt-oss、Qwen3、DeepSeek R1 和 Gemma 3 等热门开放权重模型。你可以通过 https://huggingface.co/scaleway 浏览 Scaleway 在 Hub 上的组织页面，并通过 https://huggingface.co/models?inference_provider=scaleway&sort=trending 试用其支持的热门趋势模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4275a2fc71c31481",
      "translationZh": "Scaleway Generative APIs 是一项完全托管的无服务器服务，通过简单的 API 调用，即可访问来自领先研究实验室的前沿 AI 模型。该服务按 token 计费，价格具有竞争力，起价为每百万 token €0.20。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c606c6a578dee9d",
      "translationZh": "该服务运行在位于欧洲数据中心（法国巴黎）的安全基础设施上，为欧洲用户保障数据主权并提供低延迟。该平台支持结构化输出、函数调用以及用于文本和图像处理的多模态能力等高级功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56483a7556c82d59",
      "translationZh": "Scaleway 的推理基础设施专为生产环境打造，首 token 响应时间低于 200ms，非常适合交互式应用和智能体工作流。该服务同时支持文本生成模型和嵌入模型。你可以通过 https://www.scaleway.com/en/generative-apis/ 进一步了解 Scaleway 的平台和基础设施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01de84581688274e",
      "translationZh": "有关如何将 Scaleway 用作推理提供商的更多信息，请阅读其专门的文档页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5fdfb9af6715394",
      "translationZh": "在此查看受支持模型的列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81081802da8646bb",
      "translationZh": "在网站界面中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71d763e2913402e9",
      "translationZh": "在用户账户设置中，你可以：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acf7bfc5b45f5bdb",
      "translationZh": "为你已注册的提供商设置自己的 API 密钥。如果未设置自定义密钥，你的请求将通过 HF 路由。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d74cb8ea19d4fc72",
      "translationZh": "按偏好对提供商排序。这一排序适用于模型页面中的小组件和代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10dba80cb700cfe7",
      "translationZh": "如前所述，调用 Inference Providers 时有两种模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70ad596a5abeea36",
      "translationZh": "自定义密钥（使用你自己在相应推理提供商处的 API 密钥，直接向该推理提供商发起调用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43848c3df5d9232d",
      "translationZh": "由 HF 路由（在这种情况下，你不需要提供商的令牌，费用会直接计入你的 HF 账户，而非你在提供商处的账户）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7ae8780922d4fe1",
      "translationZh": "模型页面会展示第三方推理提供商（与当前模型兼容的提供商，按用户偏好排序）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be0d888d38854a72",
      "translationZh": "通过客户端 SDK 调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbb48338870abf08",
      "translationZh": "在 Python 中使用 huggingface_hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39ebd12cb8be4471",
      "translationZh": "以下示例展示了如何以 Scaleway 作为推理提供商来使用 OpenAI 的 gpt-oss-120b。你可以使用 Hugging Face 令牌，通过 Hugging Face 自动路由请求；如果你有自己的 Scaleway API 密钥，也可以使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e034d53fcf76fd5",
      "translationZh": "注意：这需要使用较新版本的 huggingface_hub（>= 0.34.6）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11a638239fb39f43",
      "translationZh": "在 JS 中使用 @huggingface/inference",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ac8bbca9a74cfbd",
      "translationZh": "计费",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f3ebefff053c6d7",
      "translationZh": "计费方式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce0adfb59b02243e",
      "translationZh": "对于直接请求，即使用推理提供商的密钥发起的请求，由相应的提供商向你收取费用。例如，如果你使用 Scaleway API 密钥，费用就会计入你的 Scaleway 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6101607d5536134f",
      "translationZh": "对于路由请求，也就是通过 Hugging Face Hub 进行身份验证的请求，你只需按提供商的标准 API 费率付费。我们不额外加价，只是直接向你收取提供商的费用。（未来，我们可能会与提供商合作伙伴达成收入分成协议。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267e8c36449a9380",
      "translationZh": "重要提示 ‼️ PRO 用户每月可获得价值 $2 的推理额度。你可以在不同提供商之间使用这些额度。🔥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e2ea1d08ca3f42b",
      "translationZh": "订阅 Hugging Face PRO 套餐，即可获得推理额度、ZeroGPU、Spaces Dev Mode、20 倍的使用限额等权益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f78dc149c1ec0490",
      "translationZh": "我们也为已登录的免费用户提供少量免费推理额度，但如果条件允许，请升级到 PRO！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c625dbaf508de2f3",
      "translationZh": "反馈与后续计划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf060e0cea2edb62",
      "translationZh": "我们非常期待收到你的反馈！请在这里分享你的想法和/或评论：https://huggingface.co/spaces/huggingface/HuggingDiscussions/discussions/49",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
